(CC BY 3.0 US): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/us/
Attribution: Electronic Frontier Foundation (EFF).

Copied here as the bare word column (the dice-roll numbers removed), as shipped
in the xkcdpass 1.30.0 package's static/eff-long file.
